# https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/

### Miscellaneous ###
logs/*
*.log.*

public/

### Dotenv ###
# Ignore dotenv files (unencrypted), allow encrypted files with .enc
.env
.env.*
!.env.enc
!.env.*.enc

### VisualStudioCode ###
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
